OL,3,ABurnham promises to 'move quickly' on
OL,4,ANeets report
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister has said he wants to
OL,7,F"move quickly" on implementing
OL,8,Frecommendations in Alan Milburn's
OL,9,Freport on work and young people.
OL,11,FSpeaking to BBC Breakfast, Andy Burnham
OL,12,Fsaid: "This isn't about waiting forever
OL,13,Fand a long-off-promised reform, I want
OL,14,Fto get stuck into it right now."
OL,16,FMilburn's report urged more job support
OL,17,Ffor under-25s, a shake-up of the
OL,18,Fbenefits system, early intervention in
OL,19,Fschools and tax cuts for businesses
OL,20,Fhiring young people.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
