OL,3,AHome secretary plans to tackle
OL,4,A'corrosive' perception of two-tier
OL,5,Apolicing
OL,6,
OL,7,FHome Secretary Shabana Mahmood has
OL,8,Fannounced stronger guidance on police
OL,9,Fimpartiality to tackle what she called
OL,10,Fthe "corrosive and growing perception
OL,11,Fof two-tier policing".
OL,13,FSpeaking at a conference of police
OL,14,Fchiefs on Wednesday, she said "there
OL,15,Fhave been examples of differential
OL,16,Ftreatment" by officers that have
OL,17,Fallowed "some to whip up the false idea
OL,18,Fthat there is two-tier policing in this
OL,19,Fcountry".
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
